{"cell": "w10-links", "word": "فَأَنسَىٰهُ (word 10)", "type": "links", "topic": "فَأَنسَىٰهُ (word 10) · links", "words": ["فَأَنسَىٰهُ ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ"], "view": "The attribution of forgetting to Satan is compared with Moses' companion attributing forgetfulness to Satan in 18:63.", "rows": ["QURTUBI-FULL:12:42#3/r14"], "note": ""}
