{"cell": "w10-inward", "word": "فَأَنسَىٰهُ (word 10)", "type": "inward", "topic": "فَأَنسَىٰهُ (word 10) · inward", "words": ["فَأَنسَىٰهُ ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ ذِكْرَ رَبِّهِۦ"], "view": "Alternatively, love overwhelms the messenger's remembrance; in bewildered unity the lover forgets self and creation until divine life restores differentiation.", "rows": ["QASHANI:12:41-42#2/r4"], "note": ""}
